[{"id":168953710,"discussion_id":"a6fab8cc967cd9363b56bcc1ad08384f861412d9","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*tang-hao-hw-gitcode*](https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode), [*yu-xinjie62*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62) (2/2) | ✅ [*yu-xinjie62*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62), [*tang-hao-hw-gitcode*](https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n chenglongyu, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-21T13:03:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-22T10:20:59+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168953752,"discussion_id":"3e44547e805b86d187c4ebbc411c7b5781d2dc5b","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要包含两项修改：第一，移除了Flash Attention算子变长序列处理实现中，在设置多核参数时对`splitCoreMode`和`firstFullLoadS1OuterIdx`两个字段的冗余显式赋值，旨在统一参数设置逻辑至`SetSplitCoreModeParam`方法，以提升代码的一致性和可维护性。第二，修复了Flash Attention训练内核在特定分核模式（`splitCoreMode == 1`）下，S2轴循环计算时`multiCoreIdxMod3`变量赋值逻辑错误的问题，该问题可能导致并行计算任务调度或数据访问逻辑不一致，影响计算结果的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n针对第一项修改，移除了`FlashAttentionScoreTilingVarLen`类的`SetMultiCoreParamsRegbase`方法中对`multiCoreParamsRegbase_`对象的`set_splitCoreMode`和`set_firstFullLoadS1OuterIdx`调用，将这两个参数的设置逻辑集中到`SetSplitCoreModeParam`方法中，消除了代码冗余。针对第二项修改，在训练内核的主循环中引入了一个新的计数器变量`realMultiCoreInnerIdxInS2`，用于专门追踪S2轴循环内的有效迭代索引，并将`runInfo1.multiCoreIdxMod3`的计算逻辑从`multiCoreInnerIdx % 3`修正为`realMultiCoreInnerIdxInS2 % 3`，从而确保了在分核模式下该值的正确性，保障了后续依赖此值的计算逻辑的正确执行。","created_at":"2026-04-21T13:04:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-21T13:04:00+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168984283,"discussion_id":"68d215b32f9ace28af13b8174e873cc959718271","body":"/cla-check","created_at":"2026-04-21T16:19:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-21T16:19:02+08:00","user":{"id":"68b7b0307029e14522705126","login":"chenglongyu","object_id":"68b7b0307029e14522705126","name":"chenglongyu","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/aa/de/4a8ad19197e6664a36d3259150f7f9067b4d92a3660c5e5358a9e1411863f643.png?time=1786434848997","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenglongyu"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168985228,"discussion_id":"a19d596cfa411155e74ad827feb960749fd7ef52","body":"/check-cla","created_at":"2026-04-21T16:23:22+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-21T16:23:22+08:00","user":{"id":"68b7b0307029e14522705126","login":"chenglongyu","object_id":"68b7b0307029e14522705126","name":"chenglongyu","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/aa/de/4a8ad19197e6664a36d3259150f7f9067b4d92a3660c5e5358a9e1411863f643.png?time=1786434848997","html_url":"https://gitcode.c